.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
# rendered page images: regenerated by `python -m vsc_ocr render`
cache/

data/ocr/

**/book.md
**/notes.json
**/toc.generated.yaml
**/toc.json
**/book.raw.md
# the OCR draft's review log (the Final Book's is final/corrections.jsonl)
data/books/*/corrections.jsonl
# the Final Book's toc and notes are committed
!data/books/*/final/toc.json
!data/books/*/final/notes.json

# the Web Edition, generated by `python -m vsc_ocr export-web`, copied into the website
data/books/*/web/

# generated by `python -m vsc_ocr prepare-ai`, copied to the GPU cluster
data-for-ai/

**/ai
**/ai copy/

